{"4341660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echo Tower", "steam_appid": 4341660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be brave enough to climb the tower using only your hearing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo Tower is a game mixing action, puzzle and dungeon crawler where your ears replace your eyes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THEREFORE HEADPHONES ARE COMPULSORY!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AUDIO GAME FULLY ACCESSIBLE TO BLIND AND VISUALLY IMPAIRED PEOPLE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DUNGEON CRAWLER LIKE NO OTHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no light in this gigantic tower. Our heroes have only their hearing to reach the top. Use the power of echo location to navigate through the floor, conquer the challenges and defeat any threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MORE THAN 50 LEVELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor brings its own set of mysteries and dangers. Conquer them one by one and help our heroes reach the top of the tower before it's too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER THE SECRETS OF THE TOWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To bring back the light on the planet, Echo and Beepbop must find the secrets of the tower. Who build it? Where are its creators? Help our heroes find all the answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be brave enough to climb the tower using only your hearing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo Tower is a game mixing action, puzzle and dungeon crawler where your ears replace your eyes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THEREFORE HEADPHONES ARE COMPULSORY!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AUDIO GAME FULLY ACCESSIBLE TO BLIND AND VISUALLY IMPAIRED PEOPLE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DUNGEON CRAWLER LIKE NO OTHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no light in this gigantic tower. Our heroes have only their hearing to reach the top. Use the power of echo location to navigate through the floor, conquer the challenges and defeat any threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MORE THAN 50 LEVELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor brings its own set of mysteries and dangers. Conquer them one by one and help our heroes reach the top of the tower before it's too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER THE SECRETS OF THE TOWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To bring back the light on the planet, Echo and Beepbop must find the secrets of the tower. Who build it? Where are its creators? Help our heroes find all the answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Reach the top of a tower plunged into darkness using the power of echolocation. Echo Tower is an audio dungeon-crawler where your ears replace your eyes. Navigate through the floors, solve puzzles, avoid traps, defend yourself and bring back the light to the planet.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341660/969a28af372cb57fe51506c10d07812e1a06edbf/header.jpg?t=1775811238", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341660/61ff89908de3385c95549e6de5be8817d6858e51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775811238", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341660/61ff89908de3385c95549e6de5be8817d6858e51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775811238", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470 or AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirem